{"name":"Saddle Up","hex":"#ab927a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"saddle up","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To set and cinch a saddle on a horse in preparation for riding.","To set and cinch a saddle in preparation for riding."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/saddle_up"}],"entries":[{"title":"First Arsch","blocks":[{"text":"First Arsch are a Schwerin-based German punk rock band formed in 1986 by Till Lindemann, the subsequent lead singer of German band Rammstein. In First Arsch, Lindemann initially played the drums."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Arsch"},{"title":"Saddle","blocks":[{"text":"A saddle is a supportive structure for a rider of an animal, fastened to an animal's back by a girth. The most common type is equestrian. However, specialized saddles have been created for oxen, camels and other animals. The trade of making saddles is saddlery."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Saddle_with_shabrack_according_to_tradition_linked_with_Hetman_Miko%C5%82aj_Hieronim_Sieniawski.jpg/330px-Saddle_with_shabrack_according_to_tradition_linked_with_Hetman_Miko%C5%82aj_Hieronim_Sieniawski.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saddle"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/First_Arsch_-_Saddle_Up.jpg/330px-First_Arsch_-_Saddle_Up.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/First_Arsch_-_Saddle_Up.jpg/330px-First_Arsch_-_Saddle_Up.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFirst_Arsch_-_Saddle_Up.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/StubbenTristan.jpg/500px-StubbenTristan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbna